        "text": "melibo lists 43 MCP tools, including melibo_add_conversation_note, melibo_assign_conversation, melibo_create_contact, melibo_create_flow_from_template, melibo_create_folder, melibo_create_knowledge_piece, melibo_create_topic, melibo_delete_contact, melibo_delete_folder, melibo_delete_knowledge_piece, melibo_export_insights, and melibo_find_actions."
      }
    },
